      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I checked this bug as well and it seems to happen when the GameObject is enabled by default and then disabled by a script. When the GameObject is disabled by default, the event does not get called. I think the assumption is that the GameObject hasn't registered the event yet.\n\nNot sure if this is the intended behavior but it does seem to be quite counter intuitive.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
